.TH SYNORA-HEADLESS 1 "June 2026" "Synora Studio 1.0" "Synora Headless Commands"
.SH NAME
synora-headless \- Synora Studio Headless Terminal Client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python headless.py
[\-\-cli] [\-\-update-models] [\-\-execute-automation-script]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B synora-headless
is a lightweight, terminal-based interaction suite designed for pure speed and server administration without Graphical UI overhead. It connects to the core API Server to route messages natively through the terminal.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-cli
Launch the interactive terminal chat mode.
.TP
.B \-\-update-models
Force a synchronization check to pull offline AI models to the local machine.
.TP
.B \-\-execute-automation-script
Run the headless client as an automated bot, bypassing interactive TTY prompts.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start an interactive terminal chat:
.B python headless.py --cli
.SH AUTHOR
Synora Studio Framework
